<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Earth can now but tell the story</l><l>Of Thy bitter cross and pain;</l><l>She shall yet behold Thy glory</l><l>When Thou comest back to reign.</l><l>Christ is coming! Christ is coming!</l><l>Let each heart repeat the strain.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Long Thy people have been pining</l><l>For Thy peace and rest, and Thee,</l><l>Soon, in heav’nly glory shining,</l><l>Their Restorer shall they see.</l><l>Christ is coming! Christ is coming!</l><l>Haste the joyous jubilee.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>With that blessed hope before us,</l><l>Let no harp remain unstrung;</l><l>Let the mighty advent chorus</l><l>Onward roll on every tongue.</l><l>Christ is coming! Christ is coming!</l><l>Come, Lord Jesus, quickly come.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
